diff --git a/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0ea2a86
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+All ``pysemver`` subcommands now accept an optional leading ``v`` or ``V`` on version arguments (for example a git tag like ``v1.4.2``). Output is printed without the prefix.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..04504c7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`~semver.version.Version.compare` (and
+therefore to the comparison operators) is deprecated and emits a
+:class:`DeprecationWarning`. It will be removed in a future release. Strings,
+tuples, lists and :class:`~semver.version.Version` instances remain supported.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3d125e3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+:meth:`~semver.version.Version.next_version` now names its prerelease token
+keyword ``token``, consistent with ``bump_prerelease`` and ``bump_build``. The
+old ``prerelease_token`` keyword is deprecated but keeps working unchanged.
